    <eg:licence>Restricted. Pseudonymised data of REC members, accessible only to EnergyGuard consortium partners (GDPR). Only derived aggregated, anonymised or synthetic datasets may be published (CC BY 4.0).</eg:licence>
    <eg:location>Antrodoco Renewable Energy Community, Antrodoco (RI), Lazio, Italy</eg:location>
    <eg:missingValues>Empty cell = not applicable or not available (e.g. no PV plant or no battery)</eg:missingValues>
    <eg:sourceSystem>REC mapping compiled by ENGREEN as REC operator (membership data, GSE portal, plant documentation)</eg:sourceSystem>
    <eg:systemDescribed>REC members (consumers, producers, prosumers), PV plants and battery storage systems</eg:systemDescribed>
    <eg:temporalCoverage>2025 – ongoing (snapshot of the current REC configuration, 44 metering points)</eg:temporalCoverage>
    <eg:timeResolution>n/a (static dataset)</eg:timeResolution>
    <eg:updateFrequency>Updated when the REC membership or assets change</eg:updateFrequency>
  </owl:NamedIndividual>
